 (children's artwork series in hardback)","1999"],["A7(aa)","U","First English edition, second state (children's artwork series in hardback)","1999"],["A7(aaa)","U","First English edition, third state (children's artwork series in hardback)","1999"],["A7(b)","A","First American Edition (children's artwork series in hardback)","1999"],["A7(c)","U","English deluxe edition (children's artwork series in deluxe hardback)","1999"],["A7(d)","U","Ted Smart / 'The Book People' edition (children's artwork series in hardback)","1999"],["A7(e)","U","English children's edition (children's artwork series in paperback)","1999 [2000]"],["A7(ee)","U","English adult edition (original adult artwork series in paperback)","2000"],["A7(f)","A","American children's edition (children's artwork series in paperback)","2001"],["A7(g)","A","American book club edition (children's artwork series in hardback)","1999 [2001]"],["A7(h)","U","English 'celebratory' edition (children's artwork series in paperback)","2004"],["A7(i)","U","English adult edition (Michael Wildsmith photography adult artwork series in paperback)","2004"],["A7(j)","U","English adult edition (Michael Wildsmith photography adult artwork series in hardback)","2004"],["A7(k)","U","English 'signature' edition (Clare Melinsky artwork series in paperback)","2010"],["A7(l)","U","English 'signature' edition (Clare Melinsky artwork series in hardback)","2011"],["A7(m)","U","English adult edition (Andrew Davidson artwork series in paperback)","2013"],["A7(n)","A","American children's edition (Kazu Kibuishi artwork series in paperback)","2013"],["A7(o)","U","English 'The magical adventure begins\u2026' edition (line drawn artwork in paperback)","2013"],["A7(p)","U","Second English edition (children's artwork series in hardback)","2014"],["A7(pp)","U","Second English edition (children's artwork series in paperback)","2014"],["A7(q)","U","Second English adult edition (Andrew Davidson artwork in hardback)","2015"],["A7(r)","U","Second Engli